        "text_6MC6An": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>More than heat. More than massage. Four features, thoughtfully brought together in one simple 10-minute routine.</strong></p><p>Long hours sitting, driving, and looking down at a screen can leave your neck feeling tight and tired. QuestProps brings together four features to make taking time for your neck simple..</p>",
