        "text_9BnKUi": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2><em><strong>01 — GENTLE EMS STIMULATION</strong></em></h2><p>Adds gentle electrical stimulation to your daily neck relaxation routine.</p><p>What research says: A systematic review examined electrical stimulation for neck pain and found that it may be helpful when combined with other interventions, although more high-quality research is needed.</p><p><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34288255/\">Read the research — European Journal of Pain, 2022</a></p>",
