          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2><em><strong>02 — SOOTHING HEAT</strong></em></h2><p>Enjoy gentle warmth as you settle in and unwind.</p><p>What research says: Research on heat for self-management of nonspecific neck pain suggests it may be an option for comfort, but the current evidence remains limited.</p><p><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/42311469/\">Read the research — Journal of Pain Research, 2026</a></p><p></p>",
