        "text_FCpT3H": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2><em><strong>03 — HANDS-FREE MASSAGE</strong></em></h2><p>Lie back, relax, and enjoy a massage experience without holding a device.</p><p>What research says: A Cochrane review assessed massage for neck pain. It found that evidence for its benefits remains uncertain, with results depending on the studies and treatment approaches examined.</p><p><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38415786/\">Read the research — Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, 2024</a></p>",
