        "text_LJD9i3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2><em><strong>04 — 26° NECK SUPPORT</strong></em></h2><p>A built-in 26° support angle gives your neck a dedicated place to rest.</p><p>What research says: A systematic review examined how pillow design relates to neck pain and other outcomes. It found that pillow shape and height may affect cervical alignment, but it did not establish 26° as an optimal angle.</p><p><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33895703/\">Read the research — Clinical Biomechanics, 2021</a></p><h3>FOUR FEATURES. ONE EASY ROUTINE. JUST 10 MINUTES.</h3><p>Make a little time for your neck — even on your busiest days.</p>",
