            "heading": "WHAT IF NECK RESTORE ISN'T FOR ME?",
            "content": "<p><strong>180-Day Risk-Free Trial</strong></p><p>Take your time getting used to your new routine. If it's not right for you, you're covered by our 180-day trial.</p>",
